## Staple Ingredients

### Proteins

| Item | Region | Use |
|------|--------|-----|
| **Beef brisket** - Texas BBQ | Slow-smoked |
| **Chicken** - Nationwide | Fried, roasted |
| **Pork ribs** - BBQ regions | Grilled, smoked |
| **Salmon** - Pacific Northwest | Grilled, smoked |
| **Lobster** - New England | Rolls, butter |
| **Dungeness crab** - Pacific NW | Crab cakes |

