## Common Mistakes

| Mistake | How to Fix |
|---------|------------|
| Overcooking fried chicken | Maintain oil temperature, don't overcrowd |
| Not letting BBQ rest | Rest 15-30 minutes before slicing |
| Not developing BBQ flavor | Use wood chips, long cooking |
| Over-thickening chowder | Use potato starch, add gradually |

